cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AEMS (hardware, firmware, or software), please cite the paper below and, optionally, the archived software release."
title: "AEMS - Autonomous Energy Monitoring System"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, low-cost, modular platform for high-resolution energy monitoring of
  manufacturing equipment. AEMS acquires three-phase voltage and current through an isolated
  front end and a 24-bit, simultaneously sampling ADS131M08 ADC, managed by an STM32H745
  dual-core architecture that separates deterministic acquisition and on-board logging from host
  communication and control. It is supported by a host, edge-gateway, and optional cloud (AWS
  IoT) software stack for autonomous, long-duration acquisition in Industry 4.0 environments.
type: software
